  "analytics_reader: SELECT on analytics module + vw_dim_*_current (Personal key hidden). audit_reader: SELECT on vw_audit_event_redacted (no IP/user agent, no before/after bodies) and append-only history tables; full audit_event only through audit_export (approval required, export itself audited).",
